WEBVTT

00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:14.615
[ALL GASP]

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:19.228
[GROWLING]

00:00:21.012 --> 00:00:22.361
[GRUNTS]

00:00:22.405 --> 00:00:23.450
[SCREECHING]

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.321
[GRUNTS]

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:27.758
Hmm?

00:00:27.802 --> 00:00:29.760
[SHUDDERS][SCREECHING]

00:00:31.545 --> 00:00:32.589
[GRUNTING]

00:00:36.419 --> 00:00:37.507
Get back!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:46.951
Whoa.

00:00:51.042 --> 00:00:53.436
[SIGHS] Huh?

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.133
Oh no! Poppy?

00:00:56.483 --> 00:00:57.484
Hang on!

00:01:01.226 --> 00:01:02.401
[POWERING UP]

00:01:02.445 --> 00:01:03.751
[ZAPPING]

00:01:03.794 --> 00:01:05.840
♪ Get back up again

00:01:05.883 --> 00:01:07.189
Branch, my man!

00:01:07.232 --> 00:01:08.407
You are right on time.

00:01:08.451 --> 00:01:10.540
Oh, right.
Like you knew I was coming.

00:01:10.584 --> 00:01:12.194
Yes! I figured after
the third hug time...

00:01:12.237 --> 00:01:14.022
getting eaten by a Bergen
wouldn't seem so bad.

00:01:14.065 --> 00:01:16.894
And I figured there
was no way you could
do this by yourself.

00:01:16.938 --> 00:01:18.026
Guess we were both right.

00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:20.419
Hmm. All right.
Let's do this!

00:01:20.463 --> 00:01:21.551
Sooner we get to Bergen Town,

00:01:21.595 --> 00:01:22.987
sooner we can rescue
everybody...

00:01:23.031 --> 00:01:24.249
and make it home safely.

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:26.295
Wait, wait, wait.
What's your plan?

00:01:26.338 --> 00:01:27.557
I just told you.
To rescue everyone

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:28.863
and make it home safely.

00:01:28.906 --> 00:01:31.300
Okay. That's not a plan.
That's a wish list.

00:01:31.343 --> 00:01:33.563
Oh! I suppose
you have a plan.

00:01:33.607 --> 00:01:34.695
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:01:34.738 --> 00:01:36.566
First...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:37.785
we get to
the edge of Bergen Town

00:01:37.828 --> 00:01:39.482
without being spotted.

00:01:39.526 --> 00:01:40.875
Then, we get inside
by sneaking

00:01:40.918 --> 00:01:42.441
through the old
escape tunnels...

00:01:42.485 --> 00:01:44.313
which will then lead us
to the Troll Tree...

00:01:44.356 --> 00:01:45.575
right before we get caught,

00:01:45.619 --> 00:01:47.229
and suffer
a miserable death...

00:01:47.272 --> 00:01:49.797
at the hands of a horrible,
bloodthirsty Bergen!

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.234
Hold on a second,
are you scrapbooking my plan?

00:01:52.277 --> 00:01:54.715
Uh-huh. Yeah. Almost...

00:01:54.758 --> 00:01:55.759
done!

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:57.761
RECORDED VOICES: We did it!

00:02:05.813 --> 00:02:07.162
There will be no more...

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.382
scrapbooking.

00:02:11.035 --> 00:02:13.342
[POPPY SINGING]

00:02:13.385 --> 00:02:14.952
BRANCH: Do you have to sing?

00:02:14.996 --> 00:02:16.650
POPPY: I always sing
when I'm in a good mood.

00:02:16.693 --> 00:02:18.303
BRANCH: Do you
have to be in a good mood?

00:02:18.347 --> 00:02:19.740
POPPY: Why wouldn't I be?

00:02:19.783 --> 00:02:22.133
By this time tomorrow,
I'll be with all my friends!

00:02:22.177 --> 00:02:24.440
Oh, I wonder
what they're doing right now.

00:02:24.483 --> 00:02:26.007
Probably being digested.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:27.965
They're alive, Branch.
I know it!

00:02:28.009 --> 00:02:29.532
You don't know
anything, Poppy.

00:02:29.576 --> 00:02:31.273
And I can't wait to see
the look on your face...

00:02:31.316 --> 00:02:32.491
when you realize the world

00:02:32.535 --> 00:02:34.189
isn't all cupcakes
and rainbows.

00:02:34.232 --> 00:02:35.625
'Cause it isn't.

00:02:35.669 --> 00:02:37.366
Bad things happen...

00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:40.761
and there's nothing
you can do about it.

00:02:40.804 --> 00:02:43.677
Hey, I know it's not
all cupcakes and rainbows.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:46.157
But I'd rather
go through life thinking
that it mostly is...

00:02:46.201 --> 00:02:47.637
instead of being like you.

00:02:47.681 --> 00:02:49.291
You don't sing,
you don't dance.

00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:52.294
So grey all the time!
What happened to you?

00:02:52.337 --> 00:02:53.338
Shh.

00:02:54.078 --> 00:02:55.166
A Bergen?

00:02:55.732 --> 00:02:56.820
[SOFTLY] Maybe.

00:03:00.868 --> 00:03:02.478
There's no Bergen,
is there?

00:03:02.521 --> 00:03:04.828
You just said that
so I'd stop talking.

00:03:05.524 --> 00:03:06.525
[SOFTLY] Maybe.

00:03:20.844 --> 00:03:22.193
[SIGHS]

00:03:29.723 --> 00:03:31.550
So special.

00:03:33.248 --> 00:03:34.815
Good night, Cooper.

00:03:34.858 --> 00:03:37.687
Good night, Smidge.
Good night, Fuzzbert.

00:03:37.731 --> 00:03:39.907
Good night, Satin.
Good night, Chenille.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.605
Good night, Biggie.
Good night, DJ.

00:03:42.649 --> 00:03:43.998
Good night,
Guy Diamond.

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.913
[CHUCKLES]
Good night, Creek.

00:03:46.391 --> 00:03:47.523
Boop.

00:03:47.566 --> 00:03:48.872
And good night, Poppy.

00:03:57.576 --> 00:04:00.579
BRANCH:
Don't even think about it.

00:04:02.407 --> 00:04:03.626
[MOUTHING]

00:04:11.286 --> 00:04:15.377
♪ Stars shining
bright above you ♪

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.596
Really? Seriously?
More singing?

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.556
Yes, seriously!
Singing helps me relax.

00:04:20.599 --> 00:04:22.036
Maybe you ought to try it.

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:24.429
I don't sing,
and I don't relax.

00:04:24.473 --> 00:04:26.431
This is the way I am,
and I like it.

00:04:26.475 --> 00:04:28.695
I also like
a little silence.

00:04:32.699 --> 00:04:34.439
[UKULELE PLAYING]

00:04:37.921 --> 00:04:42.056
♪ Hello Darkness,
my old friend

00:04:42.099 --> 00:04:44.536
♪ I've come
to talk with you again

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.800
Hello.

00:04:46.843 --> 00:04:51.456
♪ Because a vision
softly creeping

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:56.244
♪ Left its seeds
while I was sleeping

00:04:56.287 --> 00:05:01.815
♪ And the vision
that was planted
in my brain

00:05:02.946 --> 00:05:05.383
♪ Still remains

00:05:06.123 --> 00:05:09.997
♪ Within the sound...

00:05:11.476 --> 00:05:13.957
♪ Of silence

00:05:19.658 --> 00:05:20.834
May I?

